                                                "sense_id": "b73e7b00-5f04-3aca-a10b-f5136b2d7a89",
                                                "text": "My self-love is, in every respect, more susceptible than ambitious, and I have always found that men appear to the imagination phantoms when they blame, and pigmies when they praise you."
                                            }
                                        ]
